Step 5: Test Using Postman
     1. Install and open Postman.
     2. Download Postman from: https://dl.pstmn.io/download/latest/win64
     3. Select the GET method.
     4. Enter the following URL:
https://localhost:7282/api/math/factorial/5
5. Click Send.
